Contributing packages: [Astronomical dynamics and scientific time](../features/Astronomy.lingua); [Musculoskeletal and tissue studies](../features/Biomechanics.lingua); [Chemical multiphase and living-system studies](../features/Chemical-Living.lingua); [Physical cloth hair and secondary motion](../features/Cloth.lingua); [Thermal structural and further coupled studies](../features/Coupled-Physics.lingua); [Electrothermal and specialist device physics](../features/Device-Physics.lingua); [Molecular and protein physical studies](../features/Molecular-Dynamics.lingua); [Nonlinear materials and failure](../features/Nonlinear.lingua); [Nuclear transport and coupled power studies](../features/Nuclear.lingua); [Manufacturing and civil physical processes](../features/Process-Physics.lingua)

## Scheduling interpretation

The linked packages own implementation and its task order. This Record preserves the full source requirements, interface details, examples, research, milestones, fixtures, failure cases and completion evidence. Its `#requires` edges mean all contributors are needed to close this whole contract, not that every consumer waits for this join. Former references to earlier/later stages, delivery cycles or deferred tails describe the appropriate capability subset and composed proofs; they do not restore the removed global sequence. Incomplete unrelated siblings are not regression failures. All already verified affected capabilities must continue working.

For a mixed milestone, each contributor records its verified subset, then this join runs the actual composed workflow when all contributors exist. Do not mark the full milestone done from a local helper or silently drop geographic/hosted/numerical portions. Published exports remain usable without reopening their implementation solely to await this join; fixes to real interface defects remain mandatory.


Finish each independently scheduled specialist slice only when its actual authoring/experiment workflow and independent reference proof work on the shared workspace primitives. A protein laboratory, manufacturing/civil study, circuit/device, living/chemical system, nuclear model and astronomical study remain distinct mathematics with the same identity, job, result, authority and resource machinery.

## Required workflow milestones

- [ ] **21.M01.** For the next authorized microscopic slice, run the selected molecular/protein minimization/dynamics experiment with complete parameter coverage, actual sample/ensemble/sampling evidence and a reference result; keep electronic structure, reaction and folding claims separately gated.

- [ ] **21.M02.** For each selected nonlinear/flexible/failure, manufacturing/civil or coupled thermal-structural/fluid/acoustic/geotechnical slice, author a useful bounded case, validate the declared quantity/state transfer and inspect failure/conservation/uncertainty. Geometry export or a generic adapter slot does not complete process physics.

- [ ] **21.M03.** For each selected circuit/device/electrothermal, chemical/multiphase/living/tree or nuclear-power slice, set the required domain data/conditions, run and inspect a named validated result with an independent endpoint and optional explicit model export.

- [ ] **21.M04.** For the astronomical slice, load versioned optional ephemerides and supported time/frame/dynamics inputs, run a bounded valid study and compare reference results without changing the already working generic scale/navigation engine.

- [ ] **21.M05.** Regress the stable personal/offline/hosted workspace after every slice. Preserve source rights, explicit worker/payer, fair resources, honest unsupported ranges and independent coarse/fine fidelity; never mark all specialist rows complete because one solver runs.

- [ ] **21.M06.** For each separately selected articulated secondary-motion or biomechanical slice, run a bounded body/garment/hair or musculoskeletal case from declared inputs and compare the claimed quantities with an independent reference. Preserve the already usable character/anatomy editor; realistic appearance, pose matching or an LLM explanation cannot establish tissue forces, clinical causation or physical accuracy.

