- [ ] **Cycle B — Validate the smallest useful calculation.** Reuse accepted inputs, mappings, jobs, result inspection and independent laboratory/domain endpoints. Compare a bounded authored case with an independent reference and sweep the appropriate sample/discretization/time/iteration controls; validate each model, coupling and state transfer separately before broadening its scope.

