- [ ] Instantiate the local **21.W** acceptance rows before their implementation: pin the real fixture/profile, applicable hard assertions/numeric limits, quality rubric and unit/integration/fault/native/performance evidence. Apply the existing owned requirements as well as the matrix. Record each relevant previously verified workflow exercised in composition and any temporary regression/repair; measure through actual services rather than counting checked tasks.

