- [ ] Verify every local **21.W** contract and required milestone with both hard assertions/measurements and recorded qualitative review. Confirm all required earlier capabilities still hold using current affected proofs and retained unchanged evidence; close recorded regressions at their owning stages before advancement. Optional examples and deferred calculations remain explicitly scoped, and no required workflow can disappear during summary compression.

- [ ] **R0723.** a genuine domain example shares K1–K8 and persistence/native tools, has its own evidence and limitations, and cannot silently extrapolate beyond its supported model. Keep unbuilt models explicitly deferred in this document.

